            "review_title": "Review at Red Cafe",
            "review_text": "Mykola Chystenko\nBangkok, Thailand10 contributions\n1\nThe Best Russian Cuisine in Neighborhood\nMay 2019 • Family\nOh, man, I missed that kind of food. It's like you went to grandmother's house, the same taste and the same quality. This place is the best Russian cuisine in Nha Trang so far.\nAll the menu in the Russian language, but you can use images instead. If you want to try real Russian food, you need to start with this cafe for sure. I'm not sure about the owner's English level, but he's a great man, you can find some common ground or use body language as a last resort. \nThe prices are cheap also, it's about 40-60 VND per meal.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 21, 2019",
